/p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671470/extras/df459abee3ccec649a9e8fe8f31da925.avif?t=1777217224\" width=604 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 60 FPS responsive combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random enemy encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons &amp; power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad support </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671470/extras/2473869d51d289e5ccdb45fc92595c6c.avif?t=1777217224\" width=604 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671470/extras/cf95a5d24a78f0e41339c3b20505c013.poster.avif?t=1777217224\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671470/extras/cf95a5d24a78f0e41339c3b20505c013.webm?t=1777217224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671470/extras/cf95a5d24a78f0e41339c3b20505c013.mp4?t=1777217224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
