                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Update: The developer has updated to game to address some of my concerns. That is *very cool*. 'Easy Mode' has been added, which is still very hard.\n\nRE: Unapproachable Controls: Slight turns are now possible, and a fun drifting mechanic has been implemented. This is a big help. \n\nRE: Powerups and road hazards look similar. Helpful icons have been added over power ups that help differentiate them from hazaards.\n\nRE: Death walls. The walls of the arena electrocute you, and cause damage to your car. A front end collision with a wall is basically a death sentence. This is still a frustrating way to end a match.\n\nCarsteroids is coming along well, but it still feels like an early access game. It's not quite fun yet, though it definitely has the potential to get there.\n\nI am giving this game a positive review based on my experience with the developer, and my confidence in the future of this game.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1535580600,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1536084982,
                        "voted_up": true,
                        "votes_up": 9,
                        "votes_funny": 1,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.6356797814369202,
                        "comment_count": 0,
                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": true,
                        "developer_response": "Thanks for updating your review, I really appreciate that. \nThe difficulty setting has been adjusted and some new items help your fight. The power-ups have different icons and they are more recognizable during the game. The walls are now less dangerous, especially if you upgrade your armor. \nI am still working on the new content and I'm heavy testing the game. Hope you are still enjoying play!",
                        "timestamp_dev_responded": 1561370750,
